{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;SD Dungeons&quot; is a top-down rogue-like action game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character to your liking with a variety of parts and accessories,<br>then choose your favorite from six different jobs.<br>Utilize unique skills and actions for each job and weapon to reach the depths of the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through randomly generated dungeon floors,<br>you\u2019ll encounter monsters, traps, and fate-changing gates.<br>Beyond the gate awaits paradise, hell\u2026 or perhaps a formidable boss!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might obtain powerful weapons and armor from treasure chests, monsters, or bosses!<br>Will you push forward in search of legendary items,<br>or escape safely to steadily accumulate gear and experience? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\uff1cCharacter Creation\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from various hairstyles, hair colors, eyes, and accessories to create your perfect look!<br>Whether cute or cool, design your character just the way you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Create_1.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Create_2.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\uff1cDungeon\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features two types of challenges:<br>randomly generated <strong>&quot;Dungeons&quot;</strong> and fixed-stage <strong>&quot;Quests.&quot;</strong><br>Want to test out different jobs or weapons? Try the Quest mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/ForestStageImage.png?t=1743735622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/DungeonImage.png?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\uff1cGates\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many types of gates, such as the <strong>&quot;Normal Gate,&quot;</strong> <strong>&quot;Gate of Ruin,&quot;</strong> and <strong>&quot;Escape Gate.&quot;</strong><br>A variety of gates appear randomly at each floor transition,<br>and the one you choose will determine the difficulty of the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Gates.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\uff1cJobs\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from six unique jobs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Fighter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A melee job that wields a sword and shield.<br>With balanced attack and defense, it\u2019s easy to handle.<br>Switch between standard attacks and counters to control the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Fighter.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Ranger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A long-range job that uses a bow.<br>Low defense, but exceptional range!<br>Take advantage of distance to attack freely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Ranger.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Sorcerer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A long-range job that wields a staff.<br>Like the Ranger, it has low defense, but can cast powerful magic.<br>Charge your magic to alter its effects!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Sorcerer.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Monk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A melee job that fights with fists and dual daggers.<br>Lower attack and defense, with short range, but excellent mobility.<br>Dodge enemy attacks and strike relentlessly as an infighter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Monk.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Warrior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A melee job that wields a greatsword.<br>Slow movement, but devastating attack power.<br>Observe enemy movements and land a mighty blow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Warrior.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Gunner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ranged job that uses dual guns.<br>Shorter range than the Ranger, but allows for rapid attacks.<br>Take down enemies with stylish shooting action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/Gunner.gif?t=1743735622\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Congratulations!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621980/216f247d16c52f61f7e9c6f03c19e842cb90bd9e.jpg"},{"name":"Escaped Clear!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621980/839048baaf96f7f001cefd01b96b038be3387f52.jpg"},{"name":"Familiar paths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621980/9400742b6e8d23a146c212da0e41e427316f0c94.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2621980/89e1cc9915705575ec910c92fcbf977b3677f65e.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":